     1468     input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     1469     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('pay-code', '', '',
     1470     input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     1471     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('creid', '', '',
