     1478     input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     1479     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('exch-date', '', '',
     1480     input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     1481     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('exch-rate', '', '',
     1482     input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     1483     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('exch-scale', '', '',
     1484     input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     1485     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('base-rate', '', '',
     1486     input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
