     1497     DO on stop undo, leave:
     1498       run gbl/filter.w ( input parparentproc
     1499                        , input (filter-point + chr(4) + filter-label)
     1500                        , input tbl
     1501                        , input join-tbl
     1502                        , input fld
     1503                        , input lab
     1504                        , input spr
     1505                        , input dim).
